<title>HONG KONG: Reuters 4th ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th ex-Hong Kong air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Current average ex-Hong Kong air cargo market rates in Hong Kong dollars per kg for a 100kg shipment, with volume-to-weight of six to one.</p>
<p>			     DEC 11	 NOV 15</p>
<p>			     EUROPE</p>
<p> HK-LHR		    23.02	  24.30</p>
<p> HK-FRA		    23.66	  24.50</p>
<p>			     USA</p>
<p> HK-JFK		    18.70	  24.60</p>
<p> HK-LAX		    18.20	  25.31</p>
<p>			     MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> HK-DXB		    15.75	  15.90</p>
<p>			     ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p> HK-SIN		     9.30	   9.20</p>
<p> HK-TYO		    14.60	  14.50</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines. large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>* All prices quoted in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>* The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
